    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait really?? i dont know if we should go to the hospital right now. the car is so far away and it's late. honestly they've had high sugar before and they usually just feel better after a long nap and some Gatorade. couldn't we just give them a big glass of water and wait an hour to see if they clear up? it seems like a lot of trouble if it's just dehydration.",
